---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="How-To Guides | TechPilot AI" description="Straightforward tutorials for AI, software, productivity, and everyday technology.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Learn by doing</span>
    <h1>Clear steps.<br /><span style="color:var(--mint)">Less guesswork.</span></h1>
    <p>Technology tutorials written to help you complete a task, understand the settings that matter, and avoid common mistakes along the way.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Guide collections</h2><p>Choose a topic to get started.</p></div></div>
  <section class="card-grid">
    <article class="content-card"><span class="card-icon">✳</span><span class="card-tag">AI basics</span><h3>Getting started with AI</h3><p>Learn useful prompting habits, how to check AI-generated answers, and when not to rely on a model.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card"><span class="card-icon">▤</span><span class="card-tag">Software</span><h3>Everyday software skills</h3><p>Practical workflows for common desktop and web applications, file management, and collaboration.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card"><span class="card-icon">⛨</span><span class="card-tag">Digital safety</span><h3>Privacy & security basics</h3><p>Understand account security, permissions, backups, suspicious links, and safer ways to use online services.</p></article>
  </section>
  <div class="feature-band"><div><span class="eyebrow">A useful habit</span><h2>Follow the steps, then verify.</h2><p>Interfaces and features can change. Check the date and official documentation when a setting or workflow looks different from a guide.</p></div><div class="feature-stat"><strong>Human judgment matters</strong><span>Use tutorials as a starting point, and review important results before relying on them.</span></div></div>
</BaseLayout>
